WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:41.240 --> 01:42.740
Kagura...

01:43.540 --> 01:44.620
Yes?

01:46.290 --> 01:47.460
How's this?

01:47.460 --> 01:49.920
Huh? Miyako?

01:49.920 --> 01:51.920
How about this?

01:51.920 --> 01:54.340
Hey, that's mine!

01:54.340 --> 01:57.970
It looks better on me than you, Maron!

01:57.970 --> 01:59.890
No way!

01:59.890 --> 02:04.060
Sazanka Yashiro won't have a chance with this.

02:04.060 --> 02:05.680
Sazanka-san?

02:08.900 --> 02:11.690
She's been pissing me off lately!

02:11.690 --> 02:14.400
That's because you go out of your way to annoy her.

02:14.400 --> 02:19.410
My pride as the top of the Rhythmic Gymnastics Club will be injured if I lose to her!

02:19.410 --> 02:21.570
I'll have to challenge myself with a "moonsault" next week!

02:21.570 --> 02:24.290
Um, that's not a gymnastics move...

02:24.290 --> 02:25.660
I don't care!

02:25.660 --> 02:29.500
A moonsault kick, a tornado uppercut...

02:29.500 --> 02:33.290
...whatever move there is, I have to master it! Understand?!

02:33.290 --> 02:34.500
Yeah, yeah...

02:34.500 --> 02:35.920
Say it like you mean it!

02:35.920 --> 02:37.670
Yes!!

02:37.670 --> 02:42.640
Doesn't it piss you off when Yashiro brags about a new move she's mastered?

02:42.640 --> 02:46.180
And she sent me this! What the hell is this?!

02:46.180 --> 02:49.770
I'll do this and this to it...

02:49.770 --> 02:51.770
How's this?!

02:58.650 --> 03:03.070
I think she's working hard towards her goals.

03:03.070 --> 03:06.330
You don't understand... She's our rival!

03:06.330 --> 03:10.500
Yeah, I know. It's not something you need to get mad about.

03:12.790 --> 03:15.170
Good afternoon, ladies.

03:22.180 --> 03:25.850
Yay! I finally got the CD I wanted!

03:27.680 --> 03:32.560
Kusakabe-san, I recorded some music on this cassette.

03:32.900 --> 03:36.520
Will

03:33.150 --> 03:36.520
you

03:33.270 --> 03:36.520
dance

03:33.810 --> 03:36.520
for

03:34.150 --> 03:36.520
me

03:34.310 --> 03:36.520
with

03:35.020 --> 03:36.520
this

03:35.820 --> 03:36.520
music?

03:36.820 --> 03:39.280
Class

03:36.900 --> 03:39.280
President,

03:37.020 --> 03:39.280
thank

03:37.280 --> 03:39.280
you!

03:37.400 --> 03:39.280
I'm

03:37.650 --> 03:39.280
so

03:37.780 --> 03:39.280
happy

03:39.280 --> 03:42.450
- Who am I kidding?!

03:41.780 --> 03:42.450
- No!

03:42.450 --> 03:44.030
Huh? No?

03:44.030 --> 03:45.780
Please stop it!

03:45.780 --> 03:48.240
K-K-Kusakabe-san!

03:48.240 --> 03:51.330
I'll save you!

03:53.620 --> 03:54.630
Kusakab--

03:57.300 --> 04:00.130
That was...Nagoya-kun...

04:00.130 --> 04:02.130
But...why?!

04:02.130 --> 04:07.810
That was Nagoya-kun, but why?! Why would Nagoya-kun...?! But why?!

04:08.140 --> 04:14.770
Sealed! The Proof of Fatherly Love

04:16.860 --> 04:20.490
Sorry, no one's home. No one can get the door.

04:22.070 --> 04:24.320
I said there's no one home!

04:24.320 --> 04:27.240
It's me, Minazuki!

04:27.240 --> 04:29.540
What? Me?!

04:29.540 --> 04:34.620
Yeah. You forced Kusakabe-san and Toudaiji-san into the car and took them away.

04:34.620 --> 04:38.710
But I guess it was someone else.

04:38.710 --> 04:42.720
Yeah, there's no way you would do such a thing.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.970
I'm glad...

04:44.970 --> 04:48.300
Oh, no! Then they were kidnapped!

04:48.300 --> 04:50.390
W-What should I do?!

04:50.390 --> 04:52.230
I gotta tell the police!

04:52.230 --> 04:53.980
Calm down, Class President.

04:55.730 --> 04:57.860
I think I know who it is.

04:58.150 --> 05:00.270
You know?!

05:00.270 --> 05:02.360
The guy's probably...

05:02.360 --> 05:04.610
What? You're Chiaki's...

05:04.610 --> 05:06.030
Brother?!

05:06.030 --> 05:09.700
Sorry for forcing you girls here.

05:09.700 --> 05:12.660
Oh, you could have told us beforehand...

05:12.660 --> 05:14.370
Then we wouldn't have had to...

05:14.370 --> 05:16.210
...do this.

05:17.000 --> 05:20.920
Sorry, sorry! I like to tease people, so...

05:20.920 --> 05:24.920
Anyway, there was something I wanted to ask you two...

05:24.920 --> 05:26.760
Is it about Chiaki-kun?

05:26.760 --> 05:29.890
You girls know that Chiaki ran away from home, don't you?

05:32.310 --> 05:33.350
Huh?

05:33.350 --> 05:35.890
What?! Ran away?!

05:35.890 --> 05:39.150
So he didn't tell you girls...

05:39.150 --> 05:42.150
He just said there was something he wanted to do...

05:42.150 --> 05:43.730
Something he wanted to do?

05:44.360 --> 05:46.400
Yeah, that's what he said.

05:48.660 --> 05:55.120
Is there any way you girls can ask him what he wants to do?

05:55.120 --> 05:57.960
I don't think he would tell us.

05:59.420 --> 06:04.630
Maybe it's just an excuse, since he doesn't want to continue the family business.

06:04.630 --> 06:06.170
Business?

06:06.170 --> 06:09.840
He didn't tell you that, either? We own a hospital.

06:09.840 --> 06:12.390
What? That's great!

06:12.390 --> 06:15.020
I must talk to Chiaki and...

06:15.020 --> 06:16.180
Wait!

06:16.180 --> 06:17.020
Huh?

06:17.020 --> 06:20.440
Oniisan, did you come here to take him back?

06:20.440 --> 06:21.270
What?

06:21.270 --> 06:23.730
What are you planning to talk to him about?

06:23.730 --> 06:29.610
Will you ignore his wishes and prey on his emotions to make him do your bidding?

06:29.610 --> 06:30.780
Maron...!

06:30.780 --> 06:34.160
Young people are always being manipulated by adults!

06:43.290 --> 06:45.630
That wasn't my intention...

06:47.260 --> 06:54.180
I do want him to carry on the hospital but if he doesn't want to, then that's okay.

06:54.180 --> 06:57.810
I just want to know what he's thinking.

06:57.810 --> 07:00.140
Why he left home.

07:00.140 --> 07:02.610
To know if it was something he couldn't have done without leaving home.

07:04.520 --> 07:08.900
I...I'm sorry for my outburst...

07:08.900 --> 07:09.950
It's okay.

07:09.950 --> 07:16.040
I'm glad that he has friends like you who feel this way about him.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.450
I...don't feel anything towards him...

07:18.830 --> 07:21.330
Wait up, Nagoya-kun!

07:21.330 --> 07:22.630
Chiaki-sama!

07:22.630 --> 07:24.130
And the Class President!

07:24.540 --> 07:27.420
Knock it off, Pop!

07:27.420 --> 07:29.010
- What?

07:28.130 --> 07:29.010
- Father?

07:29.010 --> 07:30.550
Isn't he your brother?

07:31.340 --> 07:32.760
You gave it away.

07:32.760 --> 07:36.390
I can't believe you're still amusing yourself by pretending...

07:36.390 --> 07:39.350
Don't get so cranky. Why don't you join us for some tea?

07:39.350 --> 07:41.520
There's your favorite pudding.

07:41.520 --> 07:43.850
Oh yeah! I'll put a flag on it, too!

07:43.850 --> 07:47.070
Wow, Nagoya-kun likes pudding?

07:47.070 --> 07:49.400
That was a long time ago!

07:49.400 --> 07:52.070
- Let's go, you two!

07:50.320 --> 07:52.070
- Hey! Wait a minute!

07:52.070 --> 07:54.070
Wait for me!

07:54.070 --> 07:56.240
Um, thank you very much.

07:56.240 --> 07:57.540
Later.

08:04.040 --> 08:05.630
Come on, just a little.

08:05.630 --> 08:06.460
No.

08:06.460 --> 08:07.920
Please!

08:07.920 --> 08:09.300
No means no!

08:09.300 --> 08:13.130
Please tell me. What did my old man say to you?

08:13.130 --> 08:15.680
Okay, then what's the thing you want to do?

08:15.680 --> 08:16.800
That is...

08:17.850 --> 08:20.890
I'll tell you if you talk to your father about it.

08:20.890 --> 08:21.890
Stingy...

08:21.890 --> 08:24.480
You got that right. I am stingy.

08:24.480 --> 08:28.320
Hello, I thought I heard voices over there.

08:28.320 --> 08:29.940
- Dad...

08:28.320 --> 08:29.980
- Your father...

08:29.980 --> 08:33.030
No, no, no. "Onii-san."

08:33.030 --> 08:34.860
What the hell are you talking about?

08:34.860 --> 08:37.780
Um, what brings you here today?

08:37.780 --> 08:40.950
It won't do you any good to get me expelled!

08:40.950 --> 08:42.620
Just the opposite.

08:42.620 --> 08:46.880
I just wanted to say hello and make sure you're taken care of, amongst other things...

08:46.880 --> 08:49.340
Wh-Wh-What other things?!

08:49.340 --> 08:53.840
Oh yeah, by the way, Maron-chan. Your last name is Kusakabe, right?

08:53.840 --> 08:57.220
I'm asking you a question! What "other things?"

08:57.220 --> 09:02.600
Is your father Kusakabe Takumi-san, the amusement park architect?

09:02.600 --> 09:04.390
Um...yes...

09:05.440 --> 09:07.230
Just as I thought.

09:07.230 --> 09:09.520
Do you have time right now?

09:09.520 --> 09:11.610
There's someone you should meet.

09:11.610 --> 09:13.780
Uh...sure...

09:13.780 --> 09:15.490
What the hell are you up to?

09:15.490 --> 09:18.200
Oh, you don't have to come, Chiaki-kun!

09:18.200 --> 09:20.200
That's not the problem here!

09:21.080 --> 09:24.580
Oh, Toudaiji-san, what are you doing--

09:29.840 --> 09:35.170
He was a professor of architecture. He retired sometime last year.

09:35.170 --> 09:43.520
He hasn't been feeling well since the beginning of the month, and needs to have his health checked out.

09:43.520 --> 09:47.100
I'm happy Chiaki-kun came with us.

09:49.980 --> 09:50.980
What is it?

09:50.980 --> 09:54.820
You're not acting as cool as you usually do.

09:54.820 --> 09:57.700
Does he act cool around you?

09:57.700 --> 09:58.700
What the...

09:58.700 --> 10:01.740
Yeah! Kinda like this...

10:01.740 --> 10:04.910
What! That's the way you think about me?

10:04.910 --> 10:08.210
Are you trying to tell me you're not that kind of person?

10:12.670 --> 10:15.970
Sensei, how are you feeling today?

10:15.970 --> 10:20.010
I brought you a special guest today.

10:21.050 --> 10:24.810
Kusakabe Maron-san, the daughter of Takumi-san.

10:31.020 --> 10:34.730
Takumi-san was well-known in college.

10:34.730 --> 10:40.160
He distinguished himself in many contests and events.

10:40.160 --> 10:45.410
Takumi-san was a student Sensei was very proud of.

10:45.410 --> 10:49.210
I thought he'd get better if he saw you.

10:50.170 --> 10:52.790
Sorry for bringing you here.

10:52.790 --> 10:54.920
No, it's no problem.

10:54.920 --> 10:57.050
How is Takumi-san?

10:57.050 --> 10:59.010
What is he doing now?

10:59.010 --> 11:00.300
I don't know...

11:01.800 --> 11:05.390
I was left behind...

11:11.310 --> 11:14.060
Notice

11:11.310 --> 11:14.060
Don't go away!

11:11.310 --> 11:14.060
I'll return right after these messages!

11:11.310 --> 11:14.060
Kaitou Jeanne

11:14.940 --> 11:17.570
Notice

11:14.940 --> 11:17.570
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:14.940 --> 11:17.570
Kaitou Jeanne

11:30.410 --> 11:31.670
Just kidding!

11:33.000 --> 11:38.050
My parents went to foreign countries separately because of their jobs...

11:38.050 --> 11:41.630
...and I haven't seen or heard from them in years.

11:41.630 --> 11:45.600
That's why I don't know what they're doing right now.

11:45.600 --> 11:49.270
Maron-chan, don't you like your parents?

11:49.270 --> 11:52.060
I think it's the other way around.

11:53.730 --> 11:56.820
Oh, yeah. I have something to show you.

11:56.820 --> 11:58.860
Let's go to that room over there.

11:58.860 --> 12:00.030
What is it?

12:01.530 --> 12:05.320
Something pretty. I think you'll be happy to see it.

12:05.990 --> 12:08.950
I wonder what it is? I'm getting excited!

12:10.080 --> 12:12.210
Go on in.

12:13.920 --> 12:16.210
It's awesome!

12:17.040 --> 12:21.630
Professor Takahashi is famous for his architectural models.

12:21.630 --> 12:25.720
Even though they are models, they cost tens of thousands of dollars...

12:25.720 --> 12:30.680
...but are probably even more valuable form an architect's perspective.

12:32.560 --> 12:35.230
I feel like Gulliver!

12:32.560 --> 12:38.820
Gulliver's Travels by Jonathan Swift

12:35.230 --> 12:37.310
Isn't it beautiful?

12:37.310 --> 12:38.820
Yes, very!

12:38.820 --> 12:41.490
Come over here, there is one more thing.

12:42.650 --> 12:47.370
Sensei's favorite is in the farthest room.

12:47.370 --> 12:49.160
Here you go, miss.

13:11.100 --> 13:12.980
Wow...

13:12.980 --> 13:14.690
An amusement park...

13:14.690 --> 13:16.350
It's beautiful...

13:16.350 --> 13:18.610
This is one of your father's models.

13:19.860 --> 13:24.280
Takumi-san's best-designed amusement park.

13:25.530 --> 13:27.030
Read the plate.

13:33.160 --> 13:35.500
Maron...Dome...

13:35.500 --> 13:41.460
Yes, the real thing was finished on May 30th.

13:41.460 --> 13:43.760
My birthday...

13:46.430 --> 13:52.260
Why did he name it after me?

13:52.260 --> 13:57.440
Why did he keep it a secret from me?

13:58.270 --> 14:00.900
There is no parent who doesn't feel this way.

14:04.780 --> 14:07.820
I'm... Excuse me...

14:18.580 --> 14:19.580
A cat?

14:23.090 --> 14:24.420
What's...

14:28.970 --> 14:30.050
It can't be...

14:44.230 --> 14:46.610
Welcome home, Maron!

14:46.610 --> 14:49.360
Where were you, Maron? You--

14:49.360 --> 14:54.120
Ah! I smell a Demon on you! A Demon! Where is it?!

15:02.840 --> 15:07.710
Well, what now? What are you going to do, Maron?

15:07.710 --> 15:09.050
What do you mean?

15:09.050 --> 15:12.140
Doesn't it have special meaning for you?

15:12.140 --> 15:15.100
Isn't that what <i>Checkmating</i> is all about?

15:15.100 --> 15:19.810
Did you think I was going to object just because it was special to me?

15:21.980 --> 15:26.980
The most important thing is the feeling that was put into the object, not the object itself.

15:26.980 --> 15:28.570
Isn't that right, Fin?

15:28.570 --> 15:29.700
Maron...

15:30.360 --> 15:35.700
So I will never forgive Demons, who take advantage of those feelings!

15:37.700 --> 15:40.910
Oh no, oh no! Sinbad!!!

15:40.910 --> 15:42.880
What? You knew?

15:47.750 --> 15:52.840
<i>"I will have the beauty of the Maron Dome tonight." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

15:52.840 --> 15:55.640
Oh, no. Sir!

15:55.640 --> 15:57.720
Sir!

15:57.720 --> 16:01.520
It's going to get busy. Oh well...

16:08.650 --> 16:10.240
- Dad!

16:09.570 --> 16:10.240
- What is it?

16:10.240 --> 16:12.150
I'm going to do my best this time!

16:12.150 --> 16:13.910
Of course.

16:13.910 --> 16:15.820
Is it because of Maron-chan?

16:15.820 --> 16:19.660
O-Of course not! I'm doing this for the police!

16:19.660 --> 16:20.370
Moron...

16:21.790 --> 16:28.000
Yes. It's the rarest piece in my collection.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.920
Then we'll start positioning our guards.

16:29.920 --> 16:31.420
No need.

16:31.420 --> 16:32.220
Huh?

16:32.220 --> 16:33.220
What?

16:33.220 --> 16:37.180
I said there was no need for guards in my house.

16:37.180 --> 16:39.680
But that's a bad idea.

16:39.680 --> 16:43.600
That's right! Our opponent is Jeanne! It's too dangerous!

16:43.600 --> 16:48.730
Dangerous? Then, could you take a look at this?

16:49.860 --> 16:52.820
What the hell is this?!

16:52.820 --> 16:53.610
Detective!

16:53.610 --> 16:55.110
What's wrong?!

16:55.110 --> 16:58.950
Oh, it's nothing... I'm okay.

16:58.950 --> 17:03.960
I understand. There is no point in us being here, then...

17:03.960 --> 17:05.460
But Dad!

17:05.460 --> 17:10.670
But we will guard the perimeter and around this room.

17:10.670 --> 17:12.800
I'll catch her!

17:13.880 --> 17:16.090
Feel free.

17:19.760 --> 17:22.310
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

17:27.150 --> 17:29.150
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

17:29.150 --> 17:30.770
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

17:30.770 --> 17:32.320
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

17:42.290 --> 17:43.870
Hello, officer!

17:45.710 --> 17:47.330
Jeanne!

17:47.330 --> 17:48.170
She's here!

17:58.090 --> 18:00.470
Don't shoot at me!

18:00.470 --> 18:01.680
Same to you!

18:03.930 --> 18:05.430
Stop, Jeanne!

18:17.900 --> 18:20.320
What is this?! I can't move!

18:20.320 --> 18:23.410
Don't move, Jeanne!

18:23.410 --> 18:25.370
It'll cut through your skin.

18:26.660 --> 18:29.540
Miyako Special, Part Nine!

18:30.210 --> 18:32.170
Crystal Spider!

18:32.170 --> 18:39.220
There are fine needles on that string and the more you move, the more they dig into your skin.

18:39.220 --> 18:41.010
Give it up!

18:41.010 --> 18:43.720
It's over for you.

18:43.720 --> 18:45.470
It's not over yet!

18:47.390 --> 18:48.440
Stop it, Jeanne!

18:58.860 --> 18:59.910
No way!

19:00.950 --> 19:02.990
Stop it, Jeanne!

19:02.990 --> 19:08.710
Have you ever considered the feelings of those you have stolen valuables from?

19:08.710 --> 19:11.080
I am Kaitou Jeanne.

19:11.080 --> 19:17.260
I keep in mind the sadness of all who are affected when I steal.

19:17.260 --> 19:19.760
Then why?!

19:19.760 --> 19:22.390
It's my duty!

19:22.390 --> 19:27.720
What kind of excuse is that? You coward!

19:27.720 --> 19:32.020
Miyako. I'm sorry, but Jeanne will...

19:33.650 --> 19:35.570
In the name of God...

19:36.980 --> 19:40.200
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:40.860 --> 19:44.280
Welcome, Kaitou Jeanne.

19:44.280 --> 19:47.870
I'll get out of here as soon as I <i>Checkmate</i> the Demon.

19:47.870 --> 19:50.210
No, you won't!

19:59.300 --> 20:02.680
I specialized in castles of the Middle Ages.

20:02.680 --> 20:06.680
I'm especially good at creating traps.

20:06.680 --> 20:10.230
This room's a good example.

20:10.230 --> 20:14.900
It really is arranged quite uniquely.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.660
Maron!

20:26.910 --> 20:30.080
Sinbad! Why?!

20:30.830 --> 20:32.540
Now's your chance! Quickly!

20:36.000 --> 20:40.550
This will finish you off. Goodbye, you two!

20:43.840 --> 20:45.300
In the name of God...

20:45.300 --> 20:47.390
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:47.390 --> 20:48.810
I seal you here!

20:50.020 --> 20:51.350
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:09.160 --> 21:10.740
Sinbad!

21:12.250 --> 21:14.330
Why did you help me?

21:14.330 --> 21:17.210
I don't want to be in your debt.

21:17.630 --> 21:19.590
It's not enough.

21:19.590 --> 21:22.010
This is all I need, Jeanne...

21:31.260 --> 21:34.600
I can't believe it! What in the world is he thinking?!

21:36.310 --> 21:40.690
He...called me Maron when he helped me...

21:41.820 --> 21:44.570
It can't be. I'm just imagining things...

21:47.490 --> 21:50.490
Are you okay, Sinbad?

21:50.490 --> 21:53.250
Don't talk to me right now...

21:57.330 --> 21:58.120
Dad...

22:01.960 --> 22:05.010
Thank you...

22:05.510 --> 22:11.350
For billions of years,

22:11.430 --> 22:20.900
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.070 --> 22:29.530
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.780 --> 22:35.830
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.450 --> 22:39.250
The huge mountains...

22:41.960 --> 22:48.880
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.380 --> 22:53.930
It took everything.

22:56.180 --> 23:02.150
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.230 --> 23:09.150
we watched the world ending...

23:09.360 --> 23:15.240
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.370 --> 23:25.000
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:34.300 --> 23:39.640
